{title: Tomar Amar}
{artist: Tahsan Mithila}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D] Tomar [Bm] amar,        [G] Tukro sutor [A] badhon
Jeno [Bm] jadur [F#m] moto,        [G] Tanche [A] amay
[Bm] Alto [F#m] kore,        [G] Badche [A] amay
[G] Vangche amar [A] sadhon,        [D] Tomar [Bm] chokhe
[G] Aayna [A] dekhe,        [Bm] Chokhe [F#m] chokhe
[G] Golpo [A] kore,        [Bm] Raat [F#m] dupure
[G] Sporsho [A] kore,        [G] Urchi ami [A] ekhon
[D] Chkher taray [F#m] ushno balish,        [G] Tomaky kebol [Em] khuje
[D] Jhoom dupure [F#m] brishti hole,        [G] Meghla keno [Em] saaje
[D] Tumi [Bm] amar,        [G] Ondhokarer [A] aalo
[Bm] Mishti [F#m] jura,        [G] Kaaner [A] dule
[Bm] Rodh [F#m] makhano,        [G] Shokal [A] jure
[G] Tumi amay basho [A] valo,        [D] Tomar haathe [F#m] shopno mdekhe
[G] Megher danay [Em] chore,        [D] Shopno diye [F#m] tomay aki
[G] Ovimaaner [Em] ghore,        [D] Tumi [Bm] amar
[G] Ondhokarer [A] aalo,        [Bm] Mishti [F#m] jura
[G] Kaaner [A] dule,        [Bm] Rodh [F#m] makhano
[G] Shokal [A] jure,        [G] Tumi amay basho [A] valo
